@SolidClass color(0 128 204) =
	func_bobbingwater : "From the Scourge of Armagon (hipnotic): its models and sounds come from the hipnotic folder.

Used to emulate water. To use, create a thin water brush and center it on the water line of the body of water to bob. The amount of the bob is the depth of the brush.

'speed' is how long in seconds it takes the brush to do one full bob."
[
	speed(float) : "Speed" :  : "Speed (units per second) or rate: see the help for this entity."
]

