Special walltype that removes itself when triggered."
[
]

@SolidClass base(Appearflags, Target, Targetname, VRWorldText) color(0 128 204) =
	func_button : "Button

Moves in its angle's direction when pressed, fires its targets, waits, then comes back. In Quake VR the player
presses it with a hand or a weapon (a button facing down or up: also by stepping on it). With health set it must be
shot instead.

Quake VR: a button can carry a label (worldtext, on its face, above its middle), and buttonEffect 3 makes it run a
console command (its targetname, for example map vrfiringrange)."
[
	speed(integer) : "Speed" : 40
	lip(integer) : "Lip" : 4
	target(target_destination) : "Target"
	health(integer) : "Health (shootable)" :  : "If set, it is pressed by shooting it."
	sounds(choices) : "Sound" : 0 =
	[
		0 : "Steam metal"
		1 : "Wooden clunk"
		2 : "Metallic click"
		3 : "In-out"
	]
	wait(float) : "Wait" : 1 : "Seconds before it comes back (-1 never)."
	delay(string) : "Delay before trigger"
	message(string) : "Message"
	spawnflags(flags) =
	[
		2 : "Starts disabled (Honey)" : 0 : "Pushed in and dead until a trigger_buttontoggle enables it."
	]
	angle(integer) : "Direction" : 0 : "The direction it moves when pressed (-1 up, -2 down)."
	buttonEffect(choices) : "Effect (Quake VR)" : 0 : "What else it does when pressed." =
	[
		0 : "None"
		1 : "Test (prints a message)"
		2 : "Tutorial (prints a message)"
		3 : "Console command: runs its targetname"
	]
	items(integer) : "Only damaged by (Honey)" :  : "Honey: weapon bits: only these weapons' damage presses it (shootable buttons)."
]

@PointClass color(0 0 128) size(0 0 0, 32 32 32) =
	func_clock : "From the Scourge of Armagon (hipnotic): its models and sounds come from the hipnotic folder.

Creates one hand of a 'clock'.

Set the angle to be the direction the clock is facing.

'event' is the targetname of the entities to trigger when hand strikes 12.
'cnt' is the time to start at.
'count' is the # of seconds it takes to make a full revolution (seconds is 60, minutes 3600, hours 43200). default is 60."
[
	count(integer) : "Count" :  : "A count: see the help for this entity."
	cnt(integer) : "Count (cnt)" :  : "A count: see the help for this entity."
]

@PointClass color(0 0 128) size(0 0 0, 32 32 32) =
	func_counter : "From the Scourge of Armagon (hipnotic): its models and sounds come from the hipnotic folder.

TOGGLE causes the counter to switch between an on and off state each time the counter is triggered.

LOOP causes the counter to repeat infinitly. The count resets to zero after reaching the value in 'count'.

STEP causes the counter to only increment when triggered. Effectively, this turns the counter into a relay with counting abilities.

RESET causes the counter to reset to 0 when restarted.

RANDOM causes the counter to generate random values in the range 1 to 'count' at the specified interval.

FINISHCOUNT causes the counter to continue counting until it reaches 'count' before shutting down even after being set to an off state.

START_ON causes the counter to be on when the level starts.

'count' specifies how many times to repeat the event. If LOOP is set, it specifies how high to count before reseting to zero. Default is 10.

'wait' the length of time between each trigger event. Default is 1 second.

'delay' how much time to wait before firing after being switched on."
[
	spawnflags(flags) =
	[
		1 : "TOGGLE" : 0
		2 : "LOOP" : 0
		4 : "STEP" : 0
		8 : "RESET" : 0
		16 : "RANDOM" : 0
		32 : "FINISHCOUNT" : 0
		64 : "START ON" : 0
	]
	wait(float) : "Wait" :  : "Seconds to wait (before it returns, resets or repeats). -1: never."
