@PointClass color(0 128 204) size(-32 -32 -24, 32 32 64) =
	func_spawn : "From the Scourge of Armagon (hipnotic): its models and sounds come from the hipnotic folder.

This will spawn a thing upon being used. The thing that is spawned depends upon the value of 'spawnfunction'.
'spawnclassname' should contain the same value as 'spawnfunction'. If 'spawnfunction' is unspecified a random monster is chosen. The angles, target and all flags are passed on Think of it like setting up a normal entity.
'spawnsilent' set this to 1 if you want a silent spawn.
'spawnmulti' set this to 1 if you want this spawn to be reoccuring."
[
	spawnflags(flags) =
	[
		1 : "big/ambush" : 0
		2 : "megahealth" : 0
	]
	spawnfunction(string) : "Spawn function" :  : "The classname (spawn function) of what it makes."
	spawnclassname(string) : "Spawned classname" :  : "The classname given to what it makes."
	spawnmulti(integer) : "Spawn several" :  : "1: it can make more than one."
]

@PointClass color(0 128 204) size(-16 -16 -24, 16 16 40) =
	func_spawn_small : "From the Scourge of Armagon (hipnotic): its models and sounds come from the hipnotic folder.

This will spawn a thing upon being used. The thing that is spawned depends upon the value of 'spawnfunction'.
'spawnclassname' should contain the same value as 'spawnfunction'. If 'spawnfunction' is unspecified a random monster is chosen. The angles, target and all flags are passed on Think of it like setting up a normal entity.
'spawnsilent' set this to 1 if you want a silent spawn.
'spawnmulti' set this to 1 if you want this spawn to be reoccuring."
