	vr_debris_piece : "Rock or brick (Quake VR)

One of the rocks or bricks that lie about the maps, placed by hand (the firing range's prop table): taken, thrown and
swung as they are, and tuned in Held Object Offsets. It is as big as the pieces lying about (vr_world_scale) and rests
