When triggered, fires lightning in the direction set in QuakeEd.
'wait' how long to wait between blasts (1.0 default) if in random mode wait is multiplied by random
'dmg' how much damage lightning should inflict (30 default)
'duration' how long each lightning attack should last (0.1 default)"
[
	spawnflags(flags) =
	[
		1 : "random" : 0
		2 : "boom" : 0
	]
	wait(float) : "Wait" :  : "Seconds to wait (before it returns, resets or repeats). -1: never."
	dmg(integer) : "Damage" :  : "Damage it deals (a mover: to what blocks it)."
	duration(float) : "Duration" :  : "Seconds it lasts."
	nextthink(float) : "Start delay (nextthink)" :  : "Seconds after the level starts before it first acts (to stagger several)."
]

@PointClass base(Appearflags) color(220 150 150) size(-8 -8 -8, 8 8 8) model(
	{{
			spawnflags & 2 ->	":progs/laser.mdl",
			spawnflags & 1 ->	":progs/s_spike.mdl",
						":progs/s_spike.mdl"
		}}
) =
	trap_shooter : "Continuous shooter

Continuously fires spikes.
'wait' time between spike (1.0 default)
'nextthink' delay before firing first spike, so multiple shooters can be stagered."
[
	nextthink(integer) : "Delay before first spike"
	wait(integer) : "Delay between spikes"
	spawnflags(Flags) =
	[
		1 : "Superspike" : 0 : "18 HP"
		2 : "Laser" : 0 : "15 HP"
		4 : "lavaball" : 0
		8 : "rocket" : 0
		16 : "silent" : 0
	]
]

@PointClass color(0 128 204) size(-16 -16 0, 16 16 32) model({ "path": "progs/spikmine.mdl" }) =
	trap_spike_mine : "Spike mine (Scourge of Armagon)

A floating mine that drifts towards the player and explodes. Models from hipnotic."
[
]

@PointClass base(Appearflags, Targetname) color(0 128 204) size(-8 -8 -8, 8 8 8) model(
	{{
			spawnflags & 2 ->	":progs/laser.mdl",
			spawnflags & 1 ->	":progs/s_spike.mdl",
						":progs/s_spike.mdl"
		}}
) =
	trap_spikeshooter : "Triggered shooter

When triggered, fires a spike in the direction set in QuakeEd. Laser, Lava and SuperLava are only for REGISTERED."
[
	spawnflags(flags) =
	[
		1 : "Superspike" : 0 : "18 HP"
		2 : "Laser" : 0 : "15 HP"
		4 : "lava" : 0
		8 : "superlava" : 0
		16 : "skilllava" : 0
		32 : "fireball" : 0
	]
]

@PointClass color(0 128 204) size(-8 -8 -8, 8 8 8) =
	trap_switched_shooter : "Continuously fires spikes.
'wait' time between spike (1.0 default)
'nextthink' delay before firing first spike, so multiple shooters can be stagered.
'state' 0 initially off, 1 initially on. (0 default)"
[
	spawnflags(flags) =
	[
		1 : "superspike" : 0
		2 : "laser" : 0
		4 : "lavaball" : 0
		8 : "rocket" : 0
		16 : "silent" : 0
	]
	wait(float) : "Wait" :  : "Seconds to wait (before it returns, resets or repeats). -1: never."
	nextthink(float) : "Start delay (nextthink)" :  : "Seconds after the level starts before it first acts (to stagger several)."
]

@PointClass color(0 128 204) size(-8 -8 -8, 8 8 8) =
	trap_tesla_coil : "From the Scourge of Armagon (hipnotic): its models and sounds come from the hipnotic folder.

targets enemies in vicinity and fires at them
'wait' how long build up should be (2 second default)
'dmg' how much damage lightning should inflict (2 + 5*skill default)
'duration' how long each lightning attack should last (continuous default)
'distance' how far the tesla coil should reach (600 default)
'state' on/off for the coil (0 default is off)
'count' number of people to target (2 default)"
[
	spawnflags(flags) =
	[
		1 : "targetenemies" : 0
	]
	wait(float) : "Wait" :  : "Seconds to wait (before it returns, resets or repeats). -1: never."
	dmg(integer) : "Damage" :  : "Damage it deals (a mover: to what blocks it)."
	duration(float) : "Duration" :  : "Seconds it lasts."
	distance(float) : "Distance" :  : "A distance (units) or an angle (degrees): see the help for this entity."
	delay(float) : "Delay" :  : "Seconds before it acts after it is triggered."
]

@PointClass color(0 128 204) size(16 16 16) model({ "path": "progs/player.mdl" }) =
	viewthing : "Debug entity: fake player model

Just for the debugging level. Don't use"
[
]

@PointClass color(0 255 0) size(-8 -8 -8, 8 8 8) =
	wallsprite : "From the Scourge of Armagon (hipnotic): its models and sounds come from the hipnotic folder.

Places a sprite on a wall. Angles should be opposite of face.

'model' sprite to place on wall. Default is 'progs/s_blood1.spr'."
[
